* text=auto eol=lf
*.wasm binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary

# Vendored upstream sources are byte-pinned by vendor/SOURCE_LOCK.json, whose
# SHA-256 values are taken over the exact bytes on disk. Never normalize line
# endings here: doing so makes scripts/check-vendor-sources.ps1 fail on a fresh
# checkout. Diffs stay enabled, so source review is unaffected.
vendor/** -text
